# cards: Ochu lasts 2 to 4 rounds (docs/plan-cards.md 8, point 4). Lucia wears Ochu (card 241, her slot
# 0x020B46FE) at 1300 points (0x020B48B6) and uses it in round 1 (all allies, no picker): the battle flags
# (0x02282940) gain 0x80; then both Fight each round (the enemies' HP pinned). Expect bit 0x80 cleared at the start
# of round 4, 5, or 6, and the points 1300 -> 1200. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213ba20 1
poke u16 0x020b48b6 1300
poke u16 0x020b46fe 241
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u32 0x02282940 flags
watch u16 0x020b48b6 points
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
shot oc_card
press A 8
wait 60
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
